Package: rechvix
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Raktim Ranjit <raktim@nodedr.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: postgresql (>= 15), postgresql-client (>= 15), openssl, adduser, ca-certificates, systemd | systemd-sysv
Homepage: https://rechvix.nodedr.com
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Open-source business software: invoicing, CRM, stock and accounts
 Rechvix connects invoicing, CRM, multi-warehouse inventory, purchasing,
 payments and double-entry accounting, with tax workpapers for India, Spain,
 the United Kingdom and the United States. It runs on your own server with a
 local PostgreSQL database. The web interface is served on port 8090.
 .
 This package installs the server, the background worker and the web
 application, creates the database and its two roles, and starts both
 services. Licensed under the GNU AGPL-3.0.
